# --- engine source lives in a SEPARATE repo ---
# A pinned fork of ZDoom/gzdoom @ g4.11.3 with our wasm patches is
# expected to live at github.com/mungus43/gzdoom (or similar).
# This repo (github.com/mungus43/tomb-engine) only carries the build
# pipeline, demo harness, postmortem, and an inventory of the engine
# patches — keeping engine sources out of this tree.
gzdoom-src/

# --- build outputs ---
build/
tools-build/
build-log*.txt
recon-log.txt
probe.txt
.ninja_*
*.o
*.obj
*.a
*.lib
*.exe
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib
*.wasm
*.wasm.map

# Allow committed wasm artifacts if/when we ship a release blob explicitly:
!demo/gzdoom.wasm
!demo/gzdoom.js

